<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Code Solutions | Account Activation</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="entire">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Account Activation</h1>
      <br>
      <h3>Hi, <%= UserName %>. Thank you for signing up with us.</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        Your account has been successfully activated by the admin. We apologise for
        any inconveniences it may have cost you.
        <br>
        Thank You.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your account is now active. You can now log in to our platform using your email and password.
        <br>
        If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="regards">
      <h4>Regards</h4>
      <p>Code Solutions Team</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>